    {
      "id": "msg_0518_T08R0601_PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureKoga",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Journal\r",
        "Special Feature: Fuchsia Gym\n",
        "Leader Koga!\r",
        "Koga is said to have a thorough\n",
        "knowledge of medicine.\r",
        "He even concocts medicine to nurse\n",
        "his Pokémon to health."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0518_T08R0601_FuchsiaCity_WardensHouse_Text_ExplainStrength",
      "en_US": [
        "Warden: Inside HM04 you’ll find\n",
        "Strength.\r",
        "It lets Pokémon move boulders when\n",
        "you’re outside of battle.\r",
        "Oh yes, did you find the Secret\n",
        "House in the Safari Zone?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0518_T08R0601_FuchsiaCity_WardensHouse_Text_GaveGoldTeethToWarden",
      "en_US": [
