    {
      "id": "msg_0518_T08R0601_FuchsiaCity_WardensHouse_Text_ThanksSonGiveYouSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "Warden: Thanks, son!\n",
        "You’re a real lifesaver!\r",
        "No one could understand a word\n",
        "that I said, not a one!\r",
        "I was too ashamed to show my face\n",
        "around the Office, even.\r",
        "Let me give you something for your\n",
        "trouble."
      ]
    },
